riment-done.txt` written with `DONE`. The TDD cycle is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Test List Phase**: Created 43 test cases covering every rule, example, and clarifying question from the MHPCO Claim Office spec.\n\n**TDD Cycles Completed:**\n- Empty item list → premium 5 G\n- Validation: unknown item types, claim mismatches, negative amounts\n- Base premiums for all 6 item types (sword, amulet, staff, potion, rune, moonstone)\n- Component block pricing (exactly 3 alike components = 60 G)\n- Component \"alike\" semantics (same type required for blocks)\n- All premium modifiers: cursed (50%), high enchantment (30%), loyalty (20%), first insurance (10%), follow-up contract (15%)\n- Two integration examples (newcomer + long-standing customer)\n- Claim payout with deductible, enchantment ≥8 (50%), dragon material (full)\n- Cap calculation (2× insurance sum), cap exhaustion across successive claims\n- Multiple items of same type with consumption tracking\n- Rounding (premium up, payout down)\n- Schema example and sequential step processing\n\n**Implementation Architecture**: `src/claim-office.ts` with `processScenario()` accepting stdin-JSON shape and returning stdout-JSON shape with `results` array. Modular structure with `validateSteps`, `calculateQuotePremium`, and `calculateClaimPayout` functions."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950269310,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-332ea328-99fa-4f47-8b20-0f7e16dca06d","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro"}}
