culate base premium for a single moonstone (component): 25 G\");\n\n  // === Building block of 3 alike components ===\n  it.todo(\"should charge 50 G base premium for 2 runes (no block)\");\n  it.todo(\"should charge 60 G base premium for 3 runes (block applies)\");\n  it.todo(\"should charge 100 G base premium for 4 runes (no block, block requires exactly 3)\");\n  it.todo(\"should charge 175 G base premium for 7 runes (no block, block requires exactly 3)\");\n\n  // === \"Alike\" components: same type required ===\n  it.todo(\"should charge 75 G base premium for 2 runes + 1 moonstone (no block, different types)\");\n  it.todo(\"should charge 120 G base premium for 3 runes + 3 moonstones (two separate blocks)\");\n\n  // === Modifier scope on multi-item policies ===\n  it.todo(\"should apply cursed surcharge only to cursed item base premium, not policy total: cursed sword (100 G) + plain amulet (60 G) → 160 G + 50 G curse = 210 G\");\n\n  // === Modifier: cursed items (50% surcharge) ===\n  it.todo(\"should add 50% cursed surcharge: cursed sword → 100 G base + 50 G cursed = 150 G + 5 G fee = 155 G\");\n\n  // === Modifier: high enchantment (≥5, 30% surcharge) ===\n  it.todo(\"should add 30% high-enchantment surcharge for enchantment >= 5: sword with enchantment 5 → 100 G base + 30 G = 130 G + 5 G fee = 135 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should not add high-enchantment surcharge for enchantment 4: sword → 100 G base + 5 G fee = 105 G\");\n\n  // === Modifier: loyalty discount (≥2 years, 20%) ===\n  it.todo(\"should apply loyalty discount for customer with exactly 2 years with MHPCO\");\n\n  // === Modifier: first insurance surcharge (10%) ===\n  it.todo(\"should apply 10% first insurance surcharge for new customer (0 years with MHPCO)\");\n\n  // === Modifier: follow-up contract discount (15%) ===\n  it.todo(\"should apply 15% follow-up contract discount after first quote\");\n\n  // === Integration: Newcomer with a cursed sword ===\n  it.todo(\"should calculate premium 165 G f